FedBCert builds on selected components of OpenFGL
(https://github.com/xkLi-Allen/OpenFGL).

The included OpenFGL code is distributed under the MIT License. The original
copyright and license notices are retained in LICENSE and the applicable
source files.

FedLap, GNNev, and the datasets accessed through PyTorch Geometric or OGB are
not included in this repository. Setup scripts obtain these resources from
their official sources. Their respective licenses and usage terms apply.

